### 변수
@host = http://localhost:8080
@policyId = 1
@userId = 100

### 1. 정책 생성
POST {{host}}/policies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policyName": "10% 할인 이벤트",
  "policyType": "EVENT",
  "discountType": "RATE",
  "discountTargetType": "ALL",
  "discountValue": 10,
  "validityType": "ABSOLUTE",
  "startDate": "2025-11-11T00:00:00",
  "endDate": "2025-12-12T00:00:00",
  "limitedQuantity": 5000,
  "minOrderAmount": 0,
  "maxDiscountAmount": 25000,
  "isActivation": true
}

### 2. 전체 조회
GET {{host}}/policies

### 3. 상세 조회
GET {{host}}/policies/{{policyId}}

### 4. 수정
PUT {{host}}/policies/{{policyId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policyName": "수정된 이벤트",
  "policyType": "EVENT",
  "discountType": "RATE",
  "discountTargetType": "ALL",
  "discountValue": 20,
  "validityType": "RELATIVE",
  "validDays": 30,
  "limitedQuantity": 2000
}

### 5. 비활성화
DELETE {{host}}/policies/{{policyId}}

### 6. 발급
POST {{host}}/policies/{{policyId}}/issue?userId={{userId}}

### 7. 웰컴 발급
POST {{host}}/welcome?userId={{userId}}
